Test rg41 (XFAIL): variables land on a word that carries a label -- must fail
// The same collision seen from the other side: writeVars() checks the
// address it is about to use, and finds the labeled word beneath it only
// because that word is marked like any other. rg42 is the same for
// constants.
100/
    cla
tgt,    cma
101/
    var w
    variables
stop
